    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Miu Miu unveils its Winter 2026 holiday campaign this week, and the Vivant top-handle bag carried by Momo of the K-pop group in the imagery takes on a rounded bowling silhouette. Its glossy calfskin body is rendered in a vivid ruby red, punctuated by a gold padlock, while an embossed logo quietly signals the brand's identity. The mini size makes it all the more charming and refined.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
