      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Simone\" is a brand-new bag introduced by YSL for Winter 2026, inspired by handwritten letters exchanged between house founder Yves Saint Laurent and a close friend. The bag resembles an oversized envelope folded from olive-green suede, with the depth and sheen of a velvet curtain. Its clean, sharp envelope lines are anchored by a metal logo clasp at the center — an effortless yet quietly commanding take on the YSL woman.",
